#. Shared message: DIAGNOSTIC_LOGS_DO_NOT_COLLECT_ACCOUNT_NAMES_EMAIL_ADDRESSES_FIL
msgid "\n\nDiagnostic logs do not collect account names, email addresses, file contents, raw system journals, or exception messages. Automatic diagnostics contain validated technical events, health checks, and system information: OS and dependency versions, timezone, session type, and aggregate account counts. Names and custom version text are omitted or irreversibly replaced; identities are never hashed. Your own feedback, reply email, and selected files are separate and may contain personal information. Review them before sending."
msgstr "\n\nI regjistris diagnostics no cjapin sù nons di accounts, direzions e-mail, contignûts dai files, gjornâi di sisteme grês o messaçs di ecezion. La diagnostiche automatiche e conten events tecnics verificâts, controi di funzionament e informazions di sisteme: versions dal sisteme operatîf e des dipendencis, fûs orari, gjenar di session e numars complessîfs di accounts. I nons e il test di version personalizât a vegnin ometûts o sostituîts in maniere irreversibile; lis identitâts no vegnin mai convertidis in hash. I tiei coments, la e-mail pe rispueste e i files sielts a son separâts e a puedin contignî informazions personâls. Controleju prime di inviâ."

